	(text "External Watchdog with window from 25.9ms to 46.8ms.\nMCU should supply signal at 30 Hz with 50% duty.\nWhen MCU failed to reset timer, WDO will be pulled down\nand disable 3.3v converter for 3.2s.\nWatchdog is powered by 5v to prevent cutoff.\nWatchdog is disabled for 3.2s during power up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
